WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Excuse me, are you still open?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
No, unfortunately, we are done for today.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.800
Ah, a pity, I wanted to buy ten of these big necklaces.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.700
Ten? Come in, I mean, step closer, feel free.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.600
Oh, thank you very much.

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.500
Ten times one thousand five hundred, fifteen thousand.

7
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.700
Oh, here they are, the big necklaces.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.300
But those are small ones, 300 dinars each.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.900
Yes, yes, those are the ones I meant.

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.100
Oh, what a big selection.

11
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.500
You had better sit down, this will take a while.

12
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.300
Take your time, don't rush.
